欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8ce7d5bef9dba1ebe19b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58809-1-9-2","ko":"아니. 나는 테니스보다 배드민턴을 더 좋아해.","zh":"不喜欢。比起网球，我更喜欢羽毛球。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니.","meaning":"不是，不用，不要","explanation":"아니：不是，不用，不要。","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65982","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"테니스보다","meaning":"网球","explanation":"테니스：网球；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"테니스","audio":"/audio/aa5ded493982a07e5a3d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37605","senseId":"1","lemma":"테니스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"테니스보다","audio":"/audio/b8984d47e9f50c868ea7.mp3"}},{"text":"배드민턴을","meaning":"羽毛球","explanation":"배드민턴：羽毛球；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"배드민턴","audio":"/audio/6f5e74e44ac9373182e2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58809","senseId":"1","lemma":"배드민턴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배드민턴을","audio":"/audio/d45528ebccff025c31f9.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아해.","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"